WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.640
<i>You guys that were on this team last year,
it was taken from you.</i>

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.200
<i>Now, go out and take this from them.</i>

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.600
<i>I just don't like what I said
and how I acted.</i>

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.880
Hey!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.360
Shut up and listen to what's going on!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.160
<i>True change has gotta come
from the inside.</i>

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.920
Whatever happened in the past, it's done.
Let's just worry about the future.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.080
Somebody had said I had a gun in my dorm.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.560
I failed two drug tests.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.320
They ended up charging me
with a second degree felony.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.120
What I did was unacceptable.
That's not what define me.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.200
<i>Let's be real,</i>

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.720
<i>if he wasn't a good football player,</i>

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.360
we wouldn't be talking to him.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.000
<i>He's a good coach,</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.280
but he lacks of knowing his players.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.520
<i>Every year, it just seems
to get worse and worse with Buddy.</i>

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.040
<i>Get going!</i>

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.800
<i>I don't know if he's changed or not.</i>

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.720
He hasn't changed towards me,
that's for sure.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:54.760
What are you doing?

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:02.200
Every day you gotta get better!
Every single day!

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.680
This is where you see what you made of.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.160
Let's go!

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.760
We're gonna size some rings up.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.160
<i>We all have to believe in ourselves.</i>

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.600
'Cause I do believe in you.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>He's down!</i>

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.160
I don't know that I can live like this.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:35.400
I'm gonna tell y'all right now,

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.240
y'all ain't gonna make fun of my shorts.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.720
Bring 'em back, Coach!

